  {
   "id": "nonblock",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 5: nonblocking caches. A simple cache blocks: while one miss is fetched, it serves nothing else."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 5 of 8: nonblocking caches"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "bk"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "bkm"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "nb"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Three loads in a row. A misses, taking 20 cycles. B hits, taking 1. C misses, another 20."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "nb"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Blocking: A's miss runs from 0 to 20. B must wait for it, then hits at 21. C's miss runs to 41."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "a1",
       "lane": "blocking",
       "start": 0,
       "end": 20,
       "label": "A miss"
      },
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "b1",
       "lane": "blocking",
       "start": 20,
       "end": 21,
       "label": "B",
       "delay": 0.3
      },
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "c1",
       "lane": "blocking",
       "start": 21,
       "end": 41,
       "label": "C miss",
       "delay": 0.6
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Hit under miss: while A is being fetched, the cache still serves hits. B is done at cycle 2."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "a2",
       "lane": "hit under miss: A, C",
       "start": 0,
       "end": 20,
       "label": "A miss"
      },
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "b2",
       "lane": "hit under miss: B",
       "start": 1,
       "end": 2,
       "label": "B",
       "delay": 0.4
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "But C is a second miss. This cache can track only one miss, so C waits until A returns. Done at 40."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "c2",
       "lane": "hit under miss: A, C",
       "start": 20,
       "end": 40,
       "label": "C miss"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Miss under miss: the cache tracks two misses at once. C starts at cycle 2, and both misses overlap. Everything is done by cycle 22."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "a3",
       "lane": "miss under miss: A",
       "start": 0,
       "end": 20,
       "label": "A miss"
      },
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "b3",
       "lane": "miss under miss: B, C",
       "start": 1,
       "end": 2,
       "label": "B",
       "delay": 0.3
      },
      {
       "action": "add_block",
       "target": "nb",
       "id": "c3",
       "lane": "miss under miss: B, C",
       "start": 2,
       "end": 22,
       "label": "C miss",
       "delay": 0.6
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "41 cycles, then 40, then 22. The misses still take 20 cycles each, but they now hide behind each other."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "blocking 41 · hit under miss 40 · miss under miss 22"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "How does the cache keep track? With miss status holding registers, MSHRs."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "nb"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "nbx"
      },
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "nbx[0]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Each outstanding miss gets one: which block is coming, and which loads wait for it. Out-of-order cores need them, since they keep executing past a load that missed."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "nbx[1]"
      },
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "nbx[2]",
       "delay": 0.5
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "And only the part of a miss that overlaps other work is hidden. So for these cores, the effective miss penalty is the non-overlapped part."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "nbx[3]"
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "nonblocking: misses overlap · tracked by MSHRs"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "critical",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
